Package: reneuro
Title: A European Energy System Model
Version: 0.1.0.9000
URL: https://optimal2050.github.io/reneuro/r/,
    https://optimal2050.github.io/reneuro/,
    https://github.com/optimal2050/reneuro
BugReports: https://github.com/optimal2050/reneuro/issues
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Oleg",
           family = "Lugovoy",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "olugovoy@optimalsolution.dev",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5546-9875"))
Description: An open, extensible model of the European energy system built on
    'energyRt', with the data, assumptions and processing steps kept
    inspectable. The current stage reproduces the core of the open PyPSA-Eur
    model and the workflow around it: reading networks, translating them into
    'energyRt' objects, sampling in space and time, solving, and comparing the
    result against the source model. Planned extensions cover alternative
    datasets, a review of the algorithms that turn raw data into model
    parameters, further sectors, and links to other models.
